{"ts":"2026-07-30T06:49:05.403Z","lvl":"debug","ctx":"app:module=llm","msg":"  think","data":{"agent":"main","preview":"The evaluation identified 6 issues. Let me categorize them:\n\n1. **遗漏 - 门店老板版小程序缺少AI智能体模块** → 需要新增子模块及功能\n2. **遗漏 - 八大预留接口中接口三、四、六、七未单独列出** → 需要补充\n3. **遗漏 - 渠道商登录门店版小程序自动切换数据看板功能** → 需要补充到门店版小程序模块\n4. **无中生有 - 估价结果页弹窗交互** → 需要修改删除\n5. **无中生有 - 价格时效标记** → 需要修改删除\n6. **不一致 - 提现需要后台审核而非实时打款** → 需要修改\n\nLet me think about the scope of changes:\n\n**Issues 4, 5, 6** - These are small scope issues (individual row text/description changes) → Can use modify_rows\n**Issues 1, 2, 3** - These involve adding missing modules/sub-modules/functions → Need to use decompose with roundInstructions\n\nLet me think more carefully:\n\nIssue 1: Missing AI智能体 sub-module under 门店老板版小程序 - this is a sub-module level issue (R2)\nIssue 2: Missing 接口三、四、六、七 under the 平台化扩展预留接口 module - this is a function level issue (R3)\nIssue 3: Missing 渠道商角色切换功能 under 门店版小程序 - this could be R3 or R4\n\nIssues 4, 5, 6 are small changes that can be done with modify_rows.\n\nActually, since issues 1, 2, 3 are significant structural changes (adding missing modules, sub-modules, functions), it's better to use decompose with roundInstructions to fix everything in one go. But issues 4, 5, 6 can be handled with modify_rows.\n\nLet me think about this differently. The issues span multiple levels:\n- R1 (模块层): No module-level changes needed\n- R2 (子模块层): Need to add AI智能体 sub-module under 门店老板版小程序; Need to add sub-modules for 接口三、四、六、七\n- R3 (功能层): Need to add functions for 渠道商角色切换; Add functions for 接口三、四、六、七\n- R4 (子功能层): Modify descriptions for seq-15, 17, 53, 57\n\nSince the issues are quite distributed, and the decompose tool with roundInstructions can handle multiple levels, let me try using decompose with roundInstructions for the structural issues, and then modify_rows for the individual row fixes.\n\nActually, let me re-read the rules more carefully:\n\n\"结构问题（大范围）（遗漏/重复/无中生有/不一致超过 3 行）→ 需重新拆解，调 decompose({ roundInstructions })\"\n\nIssues 4, 5, 6 are 3 issues (3 rows), and issues 1, 2, 3 are 3 structural issues. Let me use a combined approach:\n\nFor the structural issues (1, 2, 3) - use decompose with roundInstructions\nFor the small issues (4, 5, 6) - use modify_rows\n\nActually, wait. Let me think about this more carefully. Issues 4, 5, 6 involve modifying specific rows, which can be done with modify_rows. Issues 1, 2, 3 involve adding missing content.\n\nBut if I use decompose first, it will regenerate the whole list and the seq numbers will change. So I should do modify_rows first for the small fixes, then decompose for the structural changes.\n\nActually, the order doesn't matter much because decompose with roundInstructions will regenerate the whole list anyway, and then I'll need to evaluate again. Let me do modify_rows first for the small fixes, then decompose for structural issues.\n\nWait, actually decompose with roundInstructions says \"只传有变化的层级\" - so it will only modify the specified levels and keep the rest of the baseline. So the seq numbers might shift for the new rows but existing ones should remain mostly the same.\n\nHmm, this is getting complex. Let me take a different approach. Since there are multiple issues, let me use decompose with roundInstructions to fix all the structural issues at once, and then after that, I can use modify_rows for any remaining small fixes.\n\nLet me write the roundInstructions:\n\n**R2 (子模块层):**\n- 在\"门店老板版小程序\"模块下新增子模块\"AI智能体\"，包含估价入口、一键转发货功能\n- 在\"平台化扩展预留接口\"模块下，为接口三、四、六、七分别补充对应的子模块\n\n**R3 (功能层):**\n- 在\"门店老板版小程序→数据看板\"下补充\"渠道商专属数据看板\"功能\n- 在各接口子模块下补充接口定义、鉴权开发等具体功能\n\n**R4 (子功能层):**\n- 修正seq相关的描述（不过seq会变，所以最好用文字描述）\n\nActually, I think the cleanest approach is to just call decompose with comprehensive roundInstructions. Let me write them carefully.\n\nRound instructions:\n\nR2: \n1. 在\"门店老板版小程序\"模块下新增\"AI智能体\"子模块，包含功能：AI估价入口（对话估价）、一键转发货（估价后直接生成发货单）\n2. 在\"平台化扩展预留接口\"模块中，为接口三（回收商入驻与交易接口）新增子模块，一期行动包括：新增回收商角色和权限体系、预留交易大厅架构和接口定义\n3. 在\"平台化扩展预留接口\"模块中，为接口四（门店C端商城入驻接口）新增子模块，一期行动：预留接口定义\n4. 在\"平台化扩展预留接口\"模块中，为接口六（以旧换新对接接口）新增子模块，一期行动：预留接口定义和文档\n5. 在\"平台化扩展预留接口\"模块中，为接口七（官方行货及分期付款对接接口）新增子模块，一期行动：预留接口定义和文档\n\nR3:\n1. 在门店老板版小程序→数据看板子模块下，新增功能\"渠道商角色切换\"：渠道商登录门店版小程序时，系统自动识别角色为渠道商，展示渠道商专属数据看板（发展门店列表、交易流水明细、本月收益概览、收益报表、历史结算记录）\n2. 修正C端估价结果页的描述，去掉弹窗交互（原seq-17），改为固定提示文字\n3. 修正C端价格展示区描述，去掉价格时效标记（原seq-15），改为仅展示大字报价\n\nR4:\n1. 修正门店版和推广版提现功能描述，明确提现需后台手动审核后触发企业付款\n\nHmm, this is getting complex. Let me simplify and just try one round of decompose with focused instructions.\n\nActually, let me re-think. Issues 4, 5, 6 are \"无中生有\" and \"不一致\" which are about individual rows - these are small scope. Issues 1, 2, 3 are \"遗漏\" which are about missing content - these are larger scope.\n\nLet me try using modify_rows first for issues 4, 5, 6 (3 rows), then decompose for issues 1, 2, 3.\n\nBut I don't know the seq numbers yet... Let me query the decompose output first to see the rows.\n\nActually, the evaluate function has the seq numbers mentioned:\n- seq-17: \"免责弹窗触发\" - C端微信小程序→估价结果→价格说明与提醒\n- seq-15: \"价格时效标记\" - C端微信小程序→估价结果→双价格展示\n- seq-53: 门店老板版小程序→我的→提现操作\n- seq-57: 推广人员版小程序→首页→立即提现\n\nLet me use modify_rows to fix issues 4, 5, 6 first, then decompose for the structural issues.\n\nWait, but if I call decompose after modify_rows, the modify_rows changes will be overwritten. So the order should be:\n\n1. First call decompose with roundInstructions for structural fixes (issues 1, 2, 3)\n2. Then call modify_rows for small fixes (issues 4, 5, 6)\n3. Then evaluate\n\nOR\n\n1. First call modify_rows for small fixes (issues 4, 5, 6)\n2. Then call decompose with roundInstructions for structural fixes - but this would regenerate the list and potentially lose the modify_rows changes\n\nSo the correct order is: decompose first (structural), then modify_rows (small), then evaluate.\n\nLet me write the roundInstructions for decompose."}}
